WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.300
A field observation floats beside the notebook: a place in the shade.

2
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:08.000
The observation moves into the notebook. Its passage is highlighted and its source stays attached.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
The notebook opens a relationship map: shade, soil, shared space and a research question.

4
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.000
A connection opens beside the map: shade makes room to stay. Both sources remain in view.

5
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.000
The connected ideas become a field brief called Small spaces, living systems, with the source reference included.

6
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:26.000
The finished notebook and source card sit beside the message: Give your ideas somewhere to go.
